# A copy of a field the source constrains by another field: compat cannot compare it.
-- source.cue --
a: int
b: <a
-- target.cue --
b: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {b: v0_0.b}
-- out --
unknown
v1_0.b copies v0_0.b, which is constrained by a in the source schema and not in the new one; the checker cannot compare constraints between fields (compat rule unknown-crossfield) (rule unknown-copy) @ lens.cue:2:11
